.TH DESGRANA-GUI 1 "2026-08-21" "desgrana 1.12.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
desgrana-gui \- graphical interface for desgrana
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B desgrana-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B desgrana-gui
is a graphical front-end for
.BR desgrana (1).
Drop a session directory or a multichannel WAV file onto the window to load
it, review the channel list and stereo pairs, choose an output directory,
and click Extract.
.PP
Drop a \fI.snap\fR or \fI.scn\fR file to apply channel names and stereo
pairs. When no snapshot is in the session directory but one is found nearby,
it is offered, never applied automatically.
.PP
Once extracted, the tracks can be opened in a DAW found on \fBPATH\fR
(Ardour, Reaper, Audacity).
.SH PREFERENCES
Edit > Preferences: short filenames, JSON report, default output directory,
and the update check.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR desgrana (1)
.PP
Project homepage: https://github.com/rdalverny/desgrana
